{"entryId":"1254","paragraphs":[{"sourceId":"heilprin:sefaria-warsaw:ta:1254:1","sourceSha256":"46f7e274a9eb2de0a43b24632aa31e0d9afc17df73eba1b9540e67f0d803ae7f","englishSha256":"c7569107b40468c998e96f7f730995abb4a618e01118ceaadffa2219775c30df","citations":[{"id":"1254:1:citation-01","he":[63,115],"en":[184,196],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.10"},"reference":"Ketubot 104b:10","assessment":"The checked Bavli identifies Chiyya the Tall as the brother-in-law, then narrates the widow’s suit before Rabbah bar Shila and his later appearance before Rava.","evidence":[{"reference":"Ketubot 104b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 104b:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 104b:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]},{"id":"1254:1:citation-02","he":[117,137],"en":[198,232],"target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nedarim_8b.5"},"reference":"Nedarim 8b:5","assessment":"The Bavli explicitly gives Yitzchak bar Tavla citing Chiyya the Tall. The Yitzchak dossier has the parallel chain and several forms of the name.","evidence":[{"reference":"Nedarim 8b:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nedarim_8b.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 2146:1","target":{"entry":2146,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]},{"id":"1254:1:citation-03","he":[177,199],"en":[316,343],"target":{"entry":3473,"paragraph":1},"reference":"Seder HaDorot, Tanaim and Amoraim 3473:1","assessment":"The cited dossier reproduces the exact Nedarim chain linking Shimon, Yitzchak and Chiyya. The assumed chronology remains a question.","evidence":[{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 3473:1","target":{"entry":3473,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Nedarim 8b:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nedarim_8b.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"inlineHebrew":[0,1,2],"holds":[{"raw":"וצ\"ע כי ר' יצחק בן טבלי נראה קדום לו","reason":"Nedarim has Yitzchak transmitting Chiyya the Tall. The identity and chronology of the two Chiyya attestations are the compiler’s qualified issue.","evidence":[{"reference":"Nedarim 8b:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nedarim_8b.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 104b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"}]}],"notes":[{"text":"Ketubot gives the family setting and court appearances. Nedarim gives the named chain through Yitzchak, and the reciprocal Shimon dossier supports the pointer. The chronological puzzle remains open.","references":[],"urls":[]}],"comparisonEvidence":[{"reference":"Ketubot 104b:8","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.8"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 104b:10","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.10"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Ketubot 104b:11","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Ketubot_104b.11"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Nedarim 8b:5","target":{"url":"https://www.sefaria.org/Nedarim_8b.5"},"witness":"William Davidson Edition - Vocalized Aramaic"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 2146:1","target":{"entry":2146,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"},{"reference":"Seder HaDorot 3473:1","target":{"entry":3473,"paragraph":1},"witness":"Pinned Warsaw digital witness"}]}],"entryEvidence":[]}
